board camera pose predicted from the board UI frame (boardSafeInsets extracted
from ManagedMobileBoardUI, BoardLayout), position + slerp + FOV on one
smootherstep, zero velocity at both ends, monotonic. Awaits prewarmLakesideAssets
first (bounded), skips if the camera is not at the landing end, never rejects.
